Aerie-Purpose: Serve Aerie's own first-run setup page (components/aerie_onboarding) from Helium's
 onboarding page controller, and add the theme handler its colour step needs.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/onboarding (Helium's helium/core/onboarding-page.patch),
 chrome/chrome_paks.gni, chrome/browser/BUILD.gn, chrome/app/generated_resources.grd,
 tools/gritsettings/resource_ids.spec
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #46. Helium's page is a Svelte app downloaded from deps.ini [onboarding]; Aerie no longer
downloads it (tools/aerie_build/helium_deps.py). Helium's native side stays: the aerie://setup
WebUI config, the first-run redirect, OnboardingMessageHandler (prefs, completion) and the
import, search engine and default browser handlers. This patch swaps every reference to
components/helium_onboarding for components/aerie_onboarding (an overlay), drops the Svelte
Trusted Types policy (the Aerie page never assigns HTML), and registers
aerie_onboarding::AerieThemeHandler.

--- a/chrome/chrome_paks.gni
+++ b/chrome/chrome_paks.gni
@@ -485,13 +485,13 @@
       sources += [
         "$root_gen_dir/chrome/default_browser_modal_resources.pak",
         "$root_gen_dir/chrome/profile_picker_resources.pak",
-        "$root_gen_dir/components/helium_onboarding/resources/helium_onboarding_generated.pak",
+        "$root_gen_dir/components/aerie_onboarding/resources/aerie_onboarding_resources.pak",
       ]
       deps += [
         "//chrome/browser/resources/default_browser/default_browser_modal:resources",
         "//chrome/browser/resources/intro:resources",
         "//chrome/browser/resources/signin/profile_picker:resources",
-        "//components/helium_onboarding:generated_resources",
+        "//components/aerie_onboarding:resources",
       ]
     }
 
